# apolloui-v2 Submodule Branch

`apolloui-v2` is a git submodule. Do not leave UI edits on a detached HEAD.

When changing UI files:

1. Use the parent repo's current branch name (e.g. API on `v2.1.3` → UI on local `v2.1.3`).
2. If that local branch does not exist, create it tracking `origin/<branch>` when the remote exists.
3. If the matching branch is unclear or unavailable, ask which UI branch to use before editing.
4. Confirm with `git -C apolloui-v2 rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD` before committing UI work.
